# Keep rules for the release (R8) build.
#
# tflite_flutter references TensorFlow Lite's optional GPU delegate factory
# (org.tensorflow.lite.gpu.GpuDelegateFactory$Options), but the GPU delegate
# artifact is deliberately not bundled — HostelPass does CPU inference only.
# The class is never instantiated unless GPU acceleration is explicitly
# requested, which this app never does, so R8 is told to ignore the dangling
# reference instead of failing the shrink step.
# (Rule generated by AGP: build/app/outputs/mapping/release/missing_rules.txt)
-dontwarn org.tensorflow.lite.gpu.GpuDelegateFactory$Options
